----

= Trust Recommendations =

You're the healer — Cure/Protect/Shell/Haste/full status removal. You need: Tank, Refresh, DPS. Healing trusts are wasted on you.

{{html clean="false"}}
<table class="gt">
<thead><tr><th style="width:60px;">Slot</th><th style="width:200px;">Trust</th><th>Why</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td class="lv">1</td><td>🛡️ <strong><a href="https://www.bg-wiki.com/ffxi/August">August</a></strong></td><td>Tank — Provoke/Flash/Sentinel/Defender/Rampart/Palisade keeps mobs off you</td></tr>
<tr><td class="lv">2</td><td>🔮 <strong><a href="https://www.bg-wiki.com/ffxi/Arciela_II">Arciela II</a></strong></td><td>Slow/Paralyze/Dispel + weakness-targeted nukes — no healing overlap</td></tr>
<tr><td class="lv">3</td><td>🎵 <strong><a href="https://www.bg-wiki.com/ffxi/Joachim">Joachim</a></strong></td><td>Ballad for YOUR MP, March on melee, Elegy on mob</td></tr>
<tr><td class="lv">4</td><td>⚔️ <strong><a href="https://www.bg-wiki.com/ffxi/Zeid_II">Zeid II</a></strong></td><td>DPS + 4 stun interrupts reduce healing pressure on you</td></tr>
<tr><td class="lv">5</td><td>⚔️ <strong><a href="https://www.bg-wiki.com/ffxi/Volker">Volker</a></strong></td><td>Auto-DPS — detects August tanking, switches to Berserk/Aggressor</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
{{/html}}

